WEBVTT

00:19:28.246 --> 00:19:31.704
He's a Puerto Rican kid from Paterson,
New Jersey,

00:19:32.454 --> 00:19:35.746
first in his family to go to college.
I end up hiring him.

00:19:35.996 --> 00:19:39.579
Two years later, I get promoted and I
get to bring one analyst with me.

00:19:40.038 --> 00:19:41.663
Guess who I bring with me? I bring him.

00:19:42.329 --> 00:19:44.204
He's just got promoted
to managing director.

00:19:44.621 --> 00:19:47.496
He's just an incredible human being.
He's a great person.

00:19:47.538 --> 00:19:48.913
I'm the godfather of his son.

00:19:49.246 --> 00:19:52.204
You know, it's one of those classics, you
know, when friends become like family,

00:19:52.704 --> 00:19:54.121
he's very much in that category.

00:19:56.038 --> 00:19:59.496
Collaboration and inclusion are core
values in Morgan Stanley's culture,

00:19:59.871 --> 00:20:04.329
and they're shaping its future. Learn
more Morgan Stanley dotcoms, people.